      "title": "Viji Finance Limited announced that it expects to receive INR 89.25 million in funding",
      "body": "Viji Finance Limited announced a private placement of 12,75,00,000 warrants at a price of INR 0.70 per warrant for gross proceeds of INR 89,250,000 on March 24, 2026. The warrants will be convertible into one common share of the company at INR 2.1 per share and will mature in 18 months from the date of the allotment. The securities will be issued on preferential basis. The transaction has been approved by the board of directors of the company. The transaction included participation from new investors Vicky R. Jhaveri for 13,000,000 warrants, Rajesh Nanubhai Jhaveri for 13,000,000 warrants, Harsha Rajesh Jhaveri for 13,000,000 warrants, and other investors.",
